ت","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk42/seasons/9e20ef6a-5078-4c3a-9cc3-520df91c4278.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk58/seasons/f0d72994-c1cf-42b5-bc6f-1eba935255a5.jpg","likes":99,"dislikes":4,"views":29375,"release_date":"1484179200000","season_number":1,"description":"11 years ago, Daghan who was a young doctor candidate was found guilty and put behind the bars for killing the father of the woman (Beril) whom he loved and was about to marry. He was framed. Ender who fell in love with Beril had set him up. He had gotten rid of Sezai (Beril's father) who knew his big secret and also won Beril's heart. The person who gets Daghan out of the prison is a young and beautiful lawyer Selvi who has just started her career with Daghan's case as her first case. She has found an evidence that nobody has noticed before and convinces Daghan to reopen the case, which frees him from prison. This will be the start of everything.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.4}],"value":7.4,"age":"N/A"},"current_season_id":8122,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}